# A second table lamp for the lamp slot (issues 074, 099), drawn near top-down on the same table as lamp-table so it swaps in: a conical shade seen from above, brick trim ring, butter on the lit side and tangerine on the other, butter tip. Warmer and more orange than the linen drum.
size: 16x16
